  "body": "Claude: **suggestion**: Field chains stay unguarded: sd_journal_enumerate_fields() (sd-journal.c:3667) follows field.next_hash_offset raw, so a self-pointing field object makes `journalctl --fields` repeat that field forever, and verify never walks field chains either. Same check would fit there.",
